					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I sort of love the fact that the Foundation lets these fly around the office. I think it leads a very neat sort of atmosphere to the Foundation, because while it can be a grim, cold and clinical prison, it is also a fantastic place of oddities and magic, and I think the Foundation is at its best when both those things are evident.</p> 
				 	]]>
