					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-95882#post-1011084</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-95882/scp-368#post-1011084</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 24 Feb 2011 20:44:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dexanote</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>481882</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The more Safe humans seem to be allowed to go to the more public areas (Nose-Portal and Hopper come to mind), but not with other SCPs. If they prove to be more dangerous (Such as the Tengu, 053 and the Antimatter Parasite), or we're dangerous to them (Sufferer, Brittle Boy) they're secluded. The Foundation isn't cruel to be cruel, but to be effective.</p> <p>In this case… Well, they ARE effectively contained within their original offices, but I don't see why we wouldn't put this inside an aviary for its own safety.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
