					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-95882#post-1010852</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-95882/scp-368#post-1010852</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 24 Feb 2011 16:19:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Foweraker</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>452606</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>You know what I think makes this article one of my favourites? The Foundation will lock people with odd abilities in small rooms for the rest of their lives, and yet we let 100% unsaturated <em>paper birds</em> fly about as they like. This says a lot about The Foundation's institutional attitude to others.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
